      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nelson%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Luther Stone, a New York pioneer, built the first log house and tavern in 1836, marking the earliest settlement after the Black Hawk War.",
